--     no norm   + synth  3.20  389  6495 2.6e4 2.6e4 2.6e4 2.6e4 2.6e4 2.6e4
--
-- The 15.10 column is the all-zeros rail, NOT a bounded stream: the machine
-- has stopped.  The 3.20 -> 5.24 row is the design working -- 65 DISTINCT
